Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:32.81,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:36.22,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:39.75,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.33,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:46.22,Main,Militia,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:47.94,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.22,Main,Iron Axe,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.22,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I-I really can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:57.00,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,The militia actually looks half-decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:01:00.72,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Iron Axe is p-pretty capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:04.55,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:05.21,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:10.75,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I-I think... you should\Nj-join the militia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:12.22,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:14.38,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Y-You're very capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.20,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Y-Your swordsmanship and \Nhorsemanship are excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:20.41,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I believe if you join the militia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:22.22,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be worse than Iron Axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:25.44,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I-I believe, with your abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:28.70,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,y-you'll definitely\Nwin the Prince's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:33.70,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,H-Haven't you always wanted \Nto become a knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:37.31,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I think this is an o-opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:39.72,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,His Highness the Fourth Prince seems like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:42.30,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,someone worth putting your trust in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:46.36,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Then... Then let's both join the militia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.81,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,and then become His Highness's \Nknights together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:52.54,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I-I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:56.79,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I'm fine as I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:02.61,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,It's good enough to protect \Nthis place with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.94,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:21.02,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,O-Or you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.83,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I'll train for a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.29,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Have some confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:45.67,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Why aren't you guys sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:46.84,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.68,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Captain, we've got something to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.00,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,I have a good job to offer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.89,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,How would you like to be knighted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.86,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,K-Knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.13,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,You know my uncle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.28,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,He's one of the Duke's trusted men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.81,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,He gave me this job personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:07.19,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,He says the Fourth Prince \Nhas disrespected the Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:09.31,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,The Duke is very unhappy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:14.50,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,He wants the Fourth Prince to realize \Nwho truly rules the Western Region.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:18.31,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Are you p-planning an assassination?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.00,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,How could we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:21.97,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,He's still a prince, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:25.55,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,If we killed him, the Duke \Nwould also be implicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.31,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,I told you, this is a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:33.58,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,What do you think is the most important \Nthing for the Fourth Prince right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.35,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,It's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:38.64,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Without food, he'll have no choice \Nbut to return to the Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:40.39,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,You mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:43.95,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,The Duke has promised that \Nif we burn the food supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:49.12,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,he'll knight us and grant us the \Nlands east of the Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.39,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:52.40,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.53,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,N-No way! His Highness said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:59.13,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,this year's Months of Demons \Nmight last four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.54,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,If you burn the food,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:02.89,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,what will everyone eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:07.16,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,H-Have you forgotten what \Nhappened two years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.34,Main,Six Bad Guys,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.36,Main,Six Bad Guys,0,0,0,,We're not from Border Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:14.45,Main,Six Bad Guys,0,0,0,,Once the food stores are burned, we can \Ngo live the good life in the Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:18.75,Main,Six Bad Guys,0,0,0,,Exactly. Do you want to eat slag in \Nthis hellhole for the rest of your lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.45,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,But the food is in the Prince's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.06,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,How on earth are you going to get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.77,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:31.44,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,I remember you mentioning that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.42,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,there's an abandoned well in \Nthe ravine behind the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:37.06,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,connected to the waterways \Nbeneath the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:41.52,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,You can use it to reach the \Ncastle gardens without a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.52,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Didn't you crawl through it \Nwhen you were a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:47.01,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,What do you say? Do this for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.47,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,and you can also become a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:53.27,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,One personally knighted \Nby the Duke himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.27,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Y-You're all crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.83,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Knights are supposed to \Nfight against injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:04.27,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,They must not bow to tyranny, \Nbut protect the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:08.46,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Those who would sacrifice the \Ncommon folk for personal grudges
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.30,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,don't deserve to be knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.27,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I will never let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.14,Main,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Brian, we—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.85,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Greyhound, Greyhound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.61,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Greyhound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.81,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Now you know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:40.40,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Let's go, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:50.09,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,My name is Grey... Greyhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:55.55,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I joined the patrol with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:08:00.60,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Brian, I was chosen to be a captain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.74,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Let's go light the beacon tower together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:08.68,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,I believe, with your abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:11.71,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,you'll definitely win the Prince's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:17.81,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,H-Haven't you always wanted \Nto become a knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:22.44,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,It's good enough to protect \Nthis place with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:49.81,Main,Six Bad Guys,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.49,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.03,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Stop spacing out. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:14.83,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:17.10,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Haven't you been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:18.64,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Where's the warehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:20.21,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Through that door ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.92,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,take a turn, and it's the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.93,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,The warehouse should be\Nbeneath the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.21,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, don't try anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.01,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:06.25,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:18.02,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,You have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:48.27,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,Then let's join the militia together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:51.12,Flashback_Italics,Greyhound,0,0,0,,and then become His Highness's \Nknights together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.56,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Greyhound, let me avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.36,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,You're not part of the patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:16.43,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:22.43,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Lord Viper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.43,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Thanks for stepping in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:27.74,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,Worthless. So many of you \Ncan't handle one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.29,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,I'll have to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:34.65,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,So you're Viper, the famous \Nknight of Longsong Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.07,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Duke Ryan sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.64,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,That's right.\NAnd you're going to die here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.60,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,as the scapegoat who set \Nthe food supplies on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.97,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,I won't let you succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:03.74,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.85,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Lord Viper, let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:09.18,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,I want to make him pay for hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:13.93,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:15.70,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,Don't forget our real mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:16.52,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:22.52,Main,Fierce Scar,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're going to die in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.52,Italics,Brian,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Greyhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.41,Italics,Brian,0,0,0,,I couldn't become a knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.96,Italics,Brian,0,0,0,,and I couldn't avenge you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:40.11,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Hey. Causing such a ruckus \Nin someone else's home
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:41.56,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,isn't very appropriate, now is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.50,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:53.52,Main,Viper,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.85,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Rats that crawled in from the gutter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:07.33,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,take your filthy paws...\Noff my dried fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.43,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:26.57,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:28.19,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Hey, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:29.82,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Your wounds haven't fully healed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:32.74,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:36.35,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I already know what you did, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.77,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You saved Border Town's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.35,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You are a hero of Border Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.35,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,On behalf of everyone in Border Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:48.49,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:53.42,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.77,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,My friend Greyhound,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:58.29,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,he's the true...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.35,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.18,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:05.21,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Kihls Medde, also known as Fierce Scar,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,confessed as soon as he \Nentered the torture chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:11.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Greyhound will receive \Na funeral befitting his status.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.54,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I will also make proper \Narrangements for his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:18.21,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,They won't have to worry \Nabout their livelihood again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.39,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.64,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what about Fierce Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:28.31,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.78,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,We captured two survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.03,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,One is Fierce Scar,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:35.14,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and the other is a knight \Nfrom Longsong Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.52,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,They've both confessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:39.22,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Rest well for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.81,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I assure you in the name of Wimbledon that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,the criminals will receive \Nthe punishment they deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:48.52,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I've already arranged for others \Nto take over patrol duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.44,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,After the Months of Demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.04,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I will hold a knighting ceremony for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.22,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness, do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.19,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Yes, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.21,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You will become my knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:06.56,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,You just said you would\Npunish the criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.19,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,However, that might not be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.24,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Barov?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:16.01,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,This matter is certainly connected \Nto Duke Ryan of Longsong Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:19.84,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,That man with the severed arm \Nis one of Duke Ryan's knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.35,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,nicknamed Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.92,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,And then there's that guy named Kihls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.68,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Although he's a commoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:29.01,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,his distant uncle is Baron Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.83,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,He does have some connection\Nto the nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:34.08,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Their joint attempt to burn the food
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.56,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,must have been done on Duke Ryan's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:41.29,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Those men broke into your castle \Nand intended to burn the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.88,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,By law, they should be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:48.32,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,However, whether it's a knight of the \NStronghold or a baron's relative,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:51.35,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,they can buy their way out \Nof punishment with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:54.66,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,And if they truly were sent by the Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:57.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,the Duke certainly won't \Nstand by and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.54,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What's your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:01.77,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,In my view, we should wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.76,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Their mission failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.67,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,The Stronghold should\Nmake a move very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.00,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Baron Boris \Nrequests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:15.78,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Carter, go get Nana to \Ntreat Brian's injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.55,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Be discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.39,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.14,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Greetings, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:38.20,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:45.14,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:51.14,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I wish to apologize on \Nbehalf of my nephew for offending you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.64,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Your nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:54.72,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.87,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Kihls is my distant nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.64,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,He's been a dutiful and \Nconscientious patrolman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:01.04,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,I heard he lost his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:03.07,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,He followed the patrol captain's orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:06.14,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,snuck into your castle, \Nand committed a foolish act.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:08.94,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,When I get back, I will \Ncertainly punish him severely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:13.47,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,I got some more gold royals \Nover the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:17.10,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,I'm giving these to\NYour Highness as restitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:21.10,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Also, I heard that a knight \Nwas arrested along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:24.77,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,This knight is the captain \Nof the Duke's personal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:28.43,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,I don't know how he got \Ncaught up in this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:32.30,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,If possible, I would like \Nto make amends for him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:33.93,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Here's fifty gold royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:37.30,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,I beg Your Highness to show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:41.07,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.55,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,this assassination attempt was \Norchestrated by Duke Ryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:49.19,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:51.21,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Duke Ryan knew nothing of this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:51.98,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:55.50,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,In other words, this entire\Noperation was the personal initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.68,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,of the captain of\Nthe Duke's personal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:02.18,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. The Duke is loyal to \Nthe Graycastle royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.68,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,and would never permit such behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:12.83,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I choose to believe in the Duke's loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:15.68,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and I also understand your \Naffection for your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:19.60,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I will hold this incident \Nto be their personal act,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:20.81,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:22.90,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Thank you for your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.55,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Your Highness, then may I—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:28.93,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Well then, as a reward \Nfor the Duke's loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:34.81,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I will take it upon myself \Nto clean house for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:35.83,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Barov.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:37.19,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:39.70,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Viper, a knight of Longsong Stronghold,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:43.14,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,together with Kihls Medde, a.k.a. \NScarface, patrolman of Border Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.31,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,murdered their comrade, \Ninfiltrated the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:48.30,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and attempted to assassinate the Fourth \NPrince of the Kingdom of Graycastle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:49.56,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The evidence is conclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.56,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Sentence: death by hanging, \Nto be carried out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.89,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,H-Hanging?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:56.27,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.56,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,B-But, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.91,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,in the name of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.39,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,the crimes of nobles can be pardoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:10.06,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,If pardoning them is God's will,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.06,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,then I shall send them to meet God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.06,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Wh-What—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:18.05,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Also, as the magistrate of this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.64,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,you must attend,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.78,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and witness the justice of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:31.52,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Today, we have executed \Ntwo heinous criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.98,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Last night,\Nthey attempted to assassinate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.69,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and led men into the warehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:38.08,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,intending to burn everyone's \Nfood for the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:40.90,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Brian and Greyhound \Ndiscovered them in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.81,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Thanks to their brave resistance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.36,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,our food supplies were not destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:47.74,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,However, one of them was severely wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:50.70,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and the other heroically \Nsacrificed himself in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.96,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Some deaths are as light as a feather,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.55,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,while others are as heavy as a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.21,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The wicked have been severely punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:20:01.10,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The sacrifice of our heroes deserves \Nour respect and mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.33,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I will knight both heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:07.09,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and hold a grand funeral for Mr. Greyhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.17,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.07,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I owe you one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:29.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,If the food had been burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:31.32,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I truly wouldn't have known what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:32.96,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.60,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,I'm imposing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.06,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Helping you is helping myself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.29,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to be so skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.20,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Carter grilled me about it for ages today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.87,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,asking if I'd secretly hired \Nsome mysterious expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:43.64,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:47.40,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I said the mysterious expert \Ncan't reveal themselves yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.14,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,When the time is right, I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.70,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,I'm not stronger than your chief knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:57.31,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,It's just a little self-defense \Ntrick that witches have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:21:01.52,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,There might be more incidents \Nlike this in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:04.92,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Why don't you just stay\Nand be my bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:06.81,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I'll pay you two gold royals a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.61,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Five days on, two days off. \NPaid annual leave. How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:11.06,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Huh? Paid annual leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:15.40,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,That means every year you get a few days
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.10,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,to rest while still getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.10,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:28.77,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Your Highness, today you executed \Nthose two in the name of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:31.60,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,They were knights, relatives of nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:35.80,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,Yet you also defied the will of God
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:38.10,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,by saving Anna and protecting Nana.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:42.18,Main,Nightingale,0,0,0,,What exactly does God mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:45.42,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,It's not God hunting witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:46.45,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,it's the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:49.11,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You and I both know that \Nwitches are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.11,0:21:50.78,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,That's why I saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.77,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Whether they're a knight or a noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:54.24,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,a crime is a crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:55.97,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,and they should be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:22:00.10,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The difference lies in whom \Nthe law is made to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:03.84,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Throughout the long course of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:06.24,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,how many gods have been \Nworshiped by different people?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.35,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,And how much evil has been carried \Nout in the name of the gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:13.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I am simply doing what I believe \Nis right for my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:17.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I believe that a true god \Ncan understand my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:19.60,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,If He doesn't understand me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.48,0:22:21.96,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,then He isn't God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:31.77,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Greyhound...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.67,0:22:33.95,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,I've come to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:37.29,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,I've realized my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.77,0:22:39.68,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,After the Months of Demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:42.86,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,the Fourth Prince will hold \Na knighting ceremony for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:46.98,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nyou don't know this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:50.57,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,His Highness told me that a witch \Nsaved me with her magical powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:56.46,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,He also said that the witches will join us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.87,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,to protect Border Town \Nfrom the demonic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:03.00,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,I will wield my sword\Nto defend this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.62,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.52,0:23:09.07,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,So, farewell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:11.53,Main,Brian,0,0,0,,my friend.
